      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The article is devoted to clinical--economic analysis of modern diagnostic technology--magnetocardiography by analyzing the \"cost-effectiveness\". Economic effectiveness of diagnosis of coronary artery disease using magnetocardiography in terms of cost/effectivness is shown. The economicaly optimal sequence of several noninvasive methods for diagnosis of coronary artery disease is defined."},
